description = "[PAWN_nameDef] joined the famous Star Pilots On Channel K (aka S.P.O.C.K) and toured the star system, but eventually the band split up and their fame faded away.\n\n[PAWN_pronoun] ended up as a travelling bard playing on [PAWN_possessive] portable synthesizer as [PAWN_pronoun] traveled from spaceport to spaceport."
